    "sub_name": "作業研究實習",
    "sub_ename": "OPERATIONS RESEARCH LAB",
    "describe_ch": "學習如何使用數學方法解決問題。為了完成這個目標，你需要能轉換實際的狀況成為模型並用一些方法論解決問題。作業研究是一門非常有用的課程來幫助學生去數學化地思考。",
    "describe_eh": "To learn how to solve problems by using mathematical models. In order to do this, you need to be able to convert the realities into models and solve them by certain methodologies. Operations Research (OR) is a very useful course to help students to think mathematically.　",
