    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "上課遊戲規則 \n\n上課過程中請嚴守遊戲規則（不遲到、不使用行動裝置、不睡覺、不做非課內事）！\n\n違反三次以上遊戲規則總成績打折，從第4次開始，總成績*0.9；違反5次總成績*0.8；以此類推！\n\n1.\t每堂課必點名，點完名後翹課，則違反次數乘以３倍！\n2.\t手機出現在桌上、手上、腳上...等（含以手機拍照替代抄筆記），記一次違反「不使用行動裝置」遊戲規則！\n3.\t只要趴在桌上，就算是違反「不睡覺」之遊戲規則！\n4.\t若違反遊戲規則，每堂下課請主動申報；若未主動申報違反遊戲規則，經查知，則違反次數乘以３倍！亦歡迎檢舉喔~\n\n\nRules of the Game\n–\tWhen you are in class, you are expected to fully follow the principles of the Feng Chia code of classroom etiquette. \n–\tSeveral important etiquette aspects in my class are:\n•\tPlease make sure to be seated in class on time (before completion of roll call). \n•\tAll mobile devices must be turned off before the start of class. Mobile phone will be confiscated.\n•\tPlease do not sleep during class.\n•\tPlease don't do things unrelated to the course.\n\n–\tViolating any rules will result in a reduced chance of passing this course.\n•\tAfter the third violation of any one rule, total grades will be automatically and indisputably reduced by 10% for any subsequent violation (4 violations = 10% grade reduction; 5 violations = 20% grade reduction; 6 violations = 30% grade reduction; etc.).",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>希冀同學們在作業或是期末報告，可以遵守學術誠信，不可抄襲剽竊(plagiarism)他人圖、文字、構想！<br />\n若有作業報告，敬請使用抄襲比對系統(圖書館Turnitin)，宣告抄襲比例原則。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
